<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '20px 60px', background: '#10141A', fontFamily: "'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif", flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    {/* A · 标题块（100px） */}
    <Box style={{ height: 100, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, color: '#EDF1F5', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>
            有一类信息，读代码永远看不到
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 6, letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
            Some information never shows up in the code itself
        </Text>
    </Box>

    {/* B · 内容区（540px） */}
    <Box style={{ height: 540 }}>

        {/* 引导句 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 90, padding: '14px 22px', background: '#1D242E', borderLeft: '3px solid #E3A33E', borderRadius: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#EDF1F5' }}>
                技术尽调评估复杂度、覆盖率与维护成本，却从不评估更致命的一项：知识还能否被交接。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 6 }}>
                Due diligence measures complexity, coverage and cost — never knowledge inheritability.
            </Text>
        </Box>

        {/* 三类证据 */}
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, height: 348, marginTop: 14 }}>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 22, background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, color: '#E3A33E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>
                    01
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 10 }}>
                    沉积物淹没文物
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 4, letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
                    Signal buried under automation
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#A8B2BE', marginTop: 12 }}>
                    axios 最近 40 次提交里，20 次来自 dependabot，占 50%。不剥离自动化噪音的考古，挖出来的全是依赖升级和锁文件 diff。信噪分离必须先于一切分析 —— 报告的第一个数字是信噪比，而不是结论。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4CB8A6' }}>
                        实测 axios：20 / 40 = 50% 机器人提交
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 22, background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, color: '#E3A33E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>
                    02
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 10 }}>
                    意图随提交信息蒸发
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 4, letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
                    Intent evaporates with the commit message
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#A8B2BE', marginTop: 12 }}>
                    "fix"、"update"、"修改" —— 这类提交信息让后来者无法还原改动原因。追溯到人、靠人解释的成本极高，于是被无限推迟，直到那个人离开。含糊提交率可直接测量，我们把它列进风险分的第一个因子。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4CB8A6' }}>
                        风险因子权重 25 / 100 · 可量化
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 22, background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, color: '#E3A33E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>
                    03
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 10 }}>
                    先进后出，零痕迹
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 4, letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
                    Added, then removed — no trace left
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#A8B2BE', marginTop: 12 }}>
                    7 月 25 日加了下划线样式，次日整体删掉。当前代码库里找不到任何证据证明它存在过 —— 没有 TODO、没有注释、没有残留分支。这类信息只存在于提交历史里，读代码永远读不出来，它是这套系统唯一的护城河。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4CB8A6' }}>
                        只能从历史中挖出的信息
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        {/* 收束横条 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 66, marginTop: 14, padding: '8px 22px', background: 'rgba(227,163,62,0.08)', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(227,163,62,0.28)', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#EDF1F5' }}>
                于是问题不是「这个项目好不好」，而是<span style={{ color: '#E3A33E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>「它还能不能被交接」</span>。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 4 }}>
                So the question is not whether the code is good — it is whether it can still be handed over.
            </Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    {/* C · 页脚条（40px） */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 9 }}>
            <svg width={22} height={22} viewBox='0 0 22 22'>
                <rect x='0' y='0' width='22' height='5' fill='#232C38' />
                <rect x='0' y='5' width='22' height='6' fill='#E3A33E' />
                <rect x='0' y='11' width='22' height='5' fill='#232C38' />
                <rect x='0' y='16' width='22' height='6' fill='#1D242E' />
            </svg>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0' }}>
                代码考古学 / Code Archaeology
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0' }}>
            02 / 05
        </Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
